 "note": "RPCS3 Core 927 = Core 923 plus four increments. 927 (REWINDBOX_MVK_ASYNC_DEFINITIVE_927, REWINDBOX_GPU_BACKGROUND_GATE_927; maintainer, 11 November 2026: no protection, the lever must work, for every title that needs it): the boot record of asynchronous MoltenVK submits is removed and Automatic is every title (synchronous only when the configuration turns asynchronous texture streaming on); the wait for the last present marker before an acquisition is never abandoned; every submission of the presenting queue gets a marker and fence waits and occlusion gathers sleep until their submission is encoded; the application's move to the background closes a gate (submissions, presents, acquisitions and device waits park, the queues settle inside the transition) that opens when the application is active again. Device journals: 16 asynchronous sessions (Assassin's Creed, Black Ops II; 76,148 presents) with 0 acquisitions timed out, 0.05 ms of RSX submit per Black Ops II frame against 3.5-4.8 ms synchronous; the only device loss (IPA 650) raised as the application entered the background. 926: Black Ops II texture lookup memo hits served (4,676,476 verified reuses, 0 differences). 925 (REWINDBOX_GPU_MEMORY_PACKING_925): GPU allocations of 1 MiB or more get dedicated memory, the others the minimum-memory strategy (Black Ops II: Vulkan blocks 1136 MiB for 777-813 MiB allocated). 924 (REWINDBOX_GATE_BEFORE_LINE_924): an accurate PUTLLC defers to a starving PPU before it locks its line (Black Ops II freeze of IPA 724). SPUThread.cpp changes in do_putllc() only (924), with one exact alias: PPU and SPU codegen identities unchanged. Core 923 (pinned 4398e164), unchanged otherwise. No reservation skipped or weakened, no resolution, precision, frame limit, SPU count or priority or LLVM option changes. MoltenVK dependency of run 42733987255 (library d19d3a42). Built by the RPCS3 Core route (run 42946503173, attempt 1, source 916b8f19; Apple host harnesses run 42950534430 on 0d2b1d69). Verified offline on the downloaded artifacts with the repository verifier (pin_errors and bundle). Not measured on the iPhone; no FPS claim.",
